@startuml
[*] --> NotLoggedIn
NotLoggedIn --> CreateProfile : Create New Profile
NotLoggedIn --> Login : Login
CreateProfile --> ProfileCreated : Profile Created
Login --> LoggedIn : Login Successful
LoggedIn --> ViewProfile : View Profile
ViewProfile --> EditProfile : Edit Profile
EditProfile --> SaveProfile : Save Profile
SaveProfile --> ProfileCreated : Profile Saved
EditProfile --> CancelEdit : Cancel
CancelEdit --> ProfileCreated : Return to Profile
ViewProfile --> ViewProfileSummary : View Summary
ViewProfileSummary --> ProfileCreated : Return to Profile
ViewProfile --> DeleteProfile : Delete Profile
DeleteProfile --> NotLoggedIn : Profile Deleted
ProfileCreated --> EditProfile : Edit Profile
ProfileCreated --> ViewProfileSummary : View Summary
ProfileCreated --> DeleteProfile : Delete Profile
ProfileCreated --> ViewProfileChanges : View Changes
ViewProfileChanges --> ProfileCreated : Return to Profile
@enduml
